item.description:
In recent years, Republican-led legislatures have pushed through strict voting restrictions in a number of states that could determine the balance of the Senate this fall. We look at what voters are dealing with and how it could impact turnout on Election Day.&nbsp;

---&nbsp;

Guest: Bob Ortega, CNN Investigates Senior Writer&nbsp;

Host: David Rind&nbsp;

Producer: Paola Ortiz&nbsp;

Showrunner: Felicia Patinkin
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices

